3GPP TSG-RAN WG3 #101 R3-184481 Gothenburg, Sweden, 20-24 August 2018 3GPP TSG-RAN WG2 Meeting #NR AH 1807 R2-1810961 Montreal, Canada, 2 – 6th July 2018. Title: Reply LS on details of RAN notification area Response to: LS (R3-182431) on details of RAN notification area from RAN WG3 Release: Rel-15 Work Item: NR_newRAT-Core Source: RAN WG2 To: RAN WG3 Cc: Contact Person: Name: Alexander SAYENKO Tel. Number: E-mail Address: alex.sayenko@samsung.com Send any reply LS to: 3GPP Liaisons Coordinator, mailto:3GPPLiaison@etsi.org Attachments: 1. Overall Description: In the incoming LS R3-182431 RAN WG3 indicated that “if considered feasible in RAN2, RANAC size of 8bits may be future proof and more flexible”. RAN WG2 discussed and agreed to extend the RANAC size to 8bits. The corresponding changes will be introduced in ASN.1. 2. Actions: To RAN WG3 group. ACTION: RAN WG2 asks RAN WG3 to take the aforementioned agreement into account. 3. Date of Next TSG-RAN WG2 Meetings: TSG-RAN2 Meeting #103 20 - 24 Aug 2018 Gothenburg, Sweden. TSG-RAN2 Meeting #103bis 8 - 12 Oct 2018 Chengdu, China
